    "name":  "Circular Slim LED Panel 24W 4CCT Select | OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835 - Cutout 205mm",
    "reference":  "PLR24WOSR-3CCT-91870",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDiscover our new range of \u003cstrong\u003eSlim Recessed LED Panels\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003eCCT\u003c/strong\u003e technology, the perfect solution for versatile, high-quality lighting. With color options between \u003cstrong\u003e2700K, 3000K, 4000K and 5700K\u003c/strong\u003e, this \u003cstrong\u003ecircular downlight\u003c/strong\u003e of \u003cstrong\u003e24W\u003c/strong\u003e equipped with \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM DURIS E 2835\u003c/strong\u003e offers exceptional luminosity for any commercial environment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts modern design, 120º beam angle, and \u003cstrong\u003eNO FLICK driver\u003c/strong\u003e guarantee uniform flicker-free lighting with natural colors. Make your spaces stand out with this quality LED panel!\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003e24W LED 圆形超薄筒灯 - CCT - OSRAM CHIP\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e创新的\u003cstrong\u003eLED嵌入式灯盘\u003c/strong\u003e系列，采用\u003cstrong\u003eCCT\u003c/strong\u003e技术。\u003cstrong\u003e2700K、3000K、4000K和5700K可选\u003c/strong\u003e。配备\u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM DURIS E 2835芯片\u003c/strong\u003e，提供卓越亮度。120°广角，适用于家居、办公室、商店。配备NO FLICK驱动器，无闪烁，\u003cstrong\u003eCRI \u0026gt;85\u003c/strong\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e24W LED圆形超薄筒灯 - OSRAM CHIP 的用途：\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e娱乐中心\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e商店\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e购物中心\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e酒店\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e餐厅\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e家居\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFactorLED提供质量保证和技术资料表。\u003c/p\u003e",
